  "upload": {
    "title": "The SUV That Can Float 🌊 #shorts",
    "description": "BYD's Yangwang U8 has an emergency floating mode: when the water gets too deep, the engine shuts off, the suspension rises to its maximum height, the windows close, the A/C switches to recirculation and the sunroof opens as an escape exit. It can stay afloat for about 30 minutes and move at around 3 km/h using its four independent electric motors, the same setup that lets it do a 360-degree tank turn. Price: about 1.09 million yuan (~$150,000). Weight: about 3,460 kg.",
